title: BallThrow
---
Clown: You like balls?
-> Ofcourse! I love them!
    Clown: Well, you are in LUCK!!!
    Clown: In this game your goal is to throw THE balls against those cans over there!
    Clown: Take some time charging that throw beforehand!
    Clown: When you knock the cans over YOU GET POINTS!!!
    Clown: WOOOOOOOOO!!
-> No, I hate them!
    Clown: Shame.
===

title: Shooter
---
Clown: Wanna shoot someone?
-> YES PLEASE!
    Clown: Well, go grab that GUN over there!
    Clown: And start BLASTING!!!
    Clown: You will only have LIMITED bullets PER round.
    Clown: Which is a shame, tbh.
    Clown: Oh, I almost forgot. You can NOT try and shoot other people.
    Clown: We got a lot of complaints last year about that.
-> No...
    Clown: Americans wouldve said yes...
===

title: HammerGame
---
Clown: You like to smash?
-> I mean... I could try?
    Clown: Well, just grab the hammer over there!
    Clown: And SMASH this weird thing called a "Space Bar?" a bunch of times.
    Clown: Although I don't know how they earn anything since it's literally in space. But oh well.
    Clown: Be sure to do it AS FAST as possible!
    Clown: We have got to reach this bar somehow.
-> Get away you weirdo...
    Clown: Well I'M sorry.
===

title: WhackAMole
---
Clown: It's time to whack A mole!!!
Player: Weird way to say that, but...
->  Sure?
    Clown: Get back that ENTHUSIASM!!
    Clown: This is a FUNfair after all!
    Clown: In this game you gotta WHACK. THOSE. MOLES!
    Clown: However, they are fighting back somehow...[]+

    Clown: Just make sure not to whack the bombs.
    Clown: Don't ask me how they got them. I don't know either…
-> Not if you say it like that...
    Clown: You are no fun.
===

title: UnFinished
